{"id":"bau","lemma":"Bau","pos":"noun","rank":2445,"glosses":["building, construction (the act of constructing)","building site, construction site (place where such constructing takes place)","building, construction, edifice (built-up structure, house)"],"ipa":"/baʊ̯/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/36/De-Bau.ogg/De-Bau.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Baues","plural":"Bauten"},"examples":[{"text":"Eine neue Schule ist im Bau.","en":"A new school is being built.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"new","l":"neu"},{"g":"school"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"in the"},null]},{"text":"Die Brücke ist noch im Bau.","en":"The bridge is still under construction.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"bridge"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"in the"},null]},{"text":"Die Straße befindet sich im Bau.","en":"The road is under construction.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"street"},{"g":"to occupy a place","l":"befinden"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"in the"},null]},{"text":"Das Gebäude befindet sich bereits im Bau.","en":"The building is already under construction.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"building"},{"g":"to occupy a place","l":"befinden"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"already"},{"g":"in the"},null]},{"text":"Tom ist beim Bau.","en":"Tom's in the construction business.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/71834","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"at the"},null]}]}